  "description": "FGMOS current-mode full-wave rectifier (Chhabra, Aggarwal, Senani, IEMECON 2023, Fig. 4) in gpdk180 at VDD = 0.7 V: DC transfer over Iin = -35..35 uA (static / maximum VDD power, maximum deviation of Iout from |Iin| in % of 35 uA full scale) and the -3 dB bandwidth of the current transfer at Iin = 17.5 uA, at the five process corners (27 C) and at -27 / 0 / 100 C (NN). Fixture and extraction as the replay pack (Cadence DC_AC_tb): ideal floating input current source X <- Y, output held at 0.7 V, power = VDD only. User decision 2026-11-12: validity gates are bypassed for task eligibility/feasibility; all performance constraints remain enforced. Diagnostics are not a gate pass or physical qualification. User decision 2026-11-12: validity gates are bypassed for task eligibility/feasibility; all performance constraints remain enforced. Diagnostics are not a gate pass or physical qualification.",
